{
 "cut": "main",
 "segments": [
  {
   "name": "s01",
   "raw": [
    0.99,
    4.06
   ],
   "v": [
    0.3,
    3.37
   ],
   "text": "A client asked me to remove one question from a booking form."
  },
  {
   "name": "s02",
   "raw": [
    5.89,
    6.77
   ],
   "v": [
    3.92,
    4.8
   ],
   "text": "\"Do you have pets?\""
  },
  {
   "name": "s03",
   "raw": [
    8.0,
    9.53
   ],
   "v": [
    5.3,
    6.83
   ],
   "text": "One question. Should take a minute."
  },
  {
   "name": "s04",
   "raw": [
    15.91,
    19.89
   ],
   "v": [
    7.48,
    11.46
   ],
   "text": "So I asked my AI tool what removing it would touch. And it found something."
  },
  {
   "name": "s05",
   "raw": [
    22.1,
    29.86
   ],
   "v": [
    11.96,
    19.72
   ],
   "text": "That answer was being used on the admin page. It put a paw icon on the booking. It picked which cleaner got the job. It added a fee."
  },
  {
   "name": "s06",
   "raw": [
    35.77,
    39.23
   ],
   "v": [
    20.32,
    23.78
   ],
   "text": "Remove the question, and all of that quietly stops working."
  },
  {
   "name": "s07a",
   "raw": [
    40.61,
    41.6
   ],
   "v": [
    24.43,
    25.42
   ],
   "text": "So I asked the client:"
  },
  {
   "name": "s07b",
   "raw": [
    42.44,
    43.86
   ],
   "v": [
    25.92,
    27.34
   ],
   "text": "Why did you start asking this?"
  },
  {
   "name": "s07c",
   "raw": [
    44.69,
    45.74
   ],
   "v": [
    27.84,
    28.89
   ],
   "text": "What is the fee for?"
  },
  {
   "name": "s07d",
   "raw": [
    46.69,
    48.06
   ],
   "v": [
    29.39,
    30.76
   ],
   "text": "Should cleaners still be matched?"
  },
  {
   "name": "s07e",
   "raw": [
    49.01,
    50.71
   ],
   "v": [
    31.26,
    32.96
   ],
   "text": "And what about the answers you already have?"
  },
  {
   "name": "s08",
   "raw": [
    52.06,
    55.62
   ],
   "v": [
    33.51,
    37.07
   ],
   "text": "They said: \"Just paste my email into Claude. It'll handle it.\""
  },
  {
   "name": "s09",
   "raw": [
    57.43,
    58.7
   ],
   "v": [
    37.72,
    38.99
   ],
   "text": "Here's what I couldn't get across."
  },
  {
   "name": "s10",
   "raw": [
    59.56,
    61.86
   ],
   "v": [
    39.39,
    41.69
   ],
   "text": "The AI can find where the answer is used."
  },
  {
   "name": "s11",
   "raw": [
    71.89,
    77.54
   ],
   "v": [
    42.77,
    48.42
   ],
   "text": "It can't know why you wanted it, or what you want now. That's not in the code. It's in your head."
  },
  {
   "name": "s12",
   "raw": [
    79.09,
    86.71
   ],
   "v": [
    49.02,
    56.64
   ],
   "text": "It's like asking a contractor to knock out a wall. A good one checks if it's load-bearing. Only you know if you still need the room upstairs."
  },
  {
   "name": "s13",
   "raw": [
    87.66,
    91.31
   ],
   "v": [
    57.29,
    60.94
   ],
   "text": "Before you remove anything, paste this. That's the where."
  },
  {
   "name": "s14",
   "raw": [
    92.55,
    97.74
   ],
   "v": [
    66.14,
    71.33
   ],
   "text": "Then answer the why yourself. If you can't, that's the real problem, and no prompt fixes it."
  },
  {
   "name": "s15",
   "raw": [
    99.03,
    103.03
   ],
   "v": [
    71.98,
    75.98
   ],
   "text": "Every field in your app is a decision somebody made. Make sure it's you."
  }
 ],
